  "page_title": "'How to generate text with Azure OpenAI Service'",
  "page_description": "Learn how to generate or manipulate text, including code by using a completion endpoint in Azure OpenAI Service.",
  "page_date": "08/15/2023",
  "chunk_title": "Work with code",
  "chunk_content": "Work with code  The Codex model series is a descendant of OpenAI's base GPT-3 series that's been trained on both natural language and billions of lines of code. It's most capable in Python and proficient in over a dozen languages including C#, JavaScript, Go, Perl, PHP, Ruby, Swift, TypeScript, SQL, and even Shell.   For more information about generating code completions, see Codex models and Azure OpenAI Service.",
